<main class="sayori-home">
    <section class="sayori-section pt-16 lg:pt-24">
        <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-5">
            <p class="hero-eyebrow">CATEGORY</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem)] leading-[0.92] mt-4">
                SimpleFun:
                <span class="text-[#FFD34E]">
                    MultiPlayer
                </span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-description mt-6 max-w-2xl">
                A game which is easy, and a lot of players can play? No problem, we got your back.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-12">

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Games</span>
                    <strong>2</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Players</span>
                    <strong>multiplayer</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Commands</span>
                    <strong>2+</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Status</span>
                    <strong>Active</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="hidden lg:block">
        <div class="sticky top-8">
            <div class="sidebar-card bg-[#562447]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Games</p>
                <nav class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <a href="#fam" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[#6A2E58] hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        👨‍👩‍👧‍👦Form A Majority
                    </a>
                    <a href="#uno" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[#6A2E58] hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        🃏Uno
                    </a>
                    <a href="#coming-soon" class="sidebar-link hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        ＋ More Coming Soon
                    </a>
                </nav>
                <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--sayori-border)]">

                    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        Need a specific command?
                    </p>
                    <a href="?explore" class="sayori-btn mt-4">
                        📖 Gamebook
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="hidden lg:block min-h-[8px]"></div>

    <!-- Only visible on mobile -->
    <div class="lg:hidden mb-10 max-w-[99vw]">
        <select
            class="w-[99vw] max-w-[99vw] bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)] rounded-xl p-4 text-[var(--sayori-text)]"
            onchange="location.hash=this.value">
            <option value="">Browse Games</option>
            <option value="fam"> 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦Form A Majority </option>
            <option value="uno"> 🃏Uno </option>
        </select>
    </div>
    <div>

        <section id="minesweeper"
            class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    👨‍👩‍👧‍👦
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Form A Majoriy</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    A lot of people voting to form a majory, Oh... I guess a lot of us have played this game before.
                </p>
            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">
                        🎮 How to Play
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Very simple. I will send cute little embed with two options, A or B. Choose the one which you like. The option forming majority wins and everyone who didn't chose this option gets eliminated.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/fam">
                            /fam
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips </h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- If you know what your friends like, and you are sure that they are going to choose that opton, choose it.</li>
                        <li>- If you like A but your friends, like majority of your friends are fan of B, thn go and choose B. If you wanna win, otherwise A.</li>
                        <li>- Being in majority is what matters.
                        </li>
                        <li>- Do not try to be oversmart and think that you can see which side is up and vote at the last second to secure your majority side.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="min-h-[3px]"></div>
        <section id="uno"
            class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    🃏
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Uno</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    Stacking card game, wohooo!
                </p>
            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎮 How to Play</h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        I am sorry, I don't know how to play Uno. Just kidding, I do know.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- There is a card at the top of the deck. you have to choose a card from your hand which is either having the same colour or number as the top card.</li>
                        <li>- There are some power cards which you can use in middle of the game, over the card of the same colour..</li>
                        <li>- Some powercards are stackabled [+2].</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/uno">
                            /uno
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tidbits:</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Reverse card is used to rotate the cycle.</li>
                        <li>- +2 card is used to make the next player take 2 cards.</li>
                        <li>- Skip/block card is used to skip the turn of the next person..</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips:</h3>
                    <p>I am really not the best person to give tips.</p>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Choose the cards wisely.</li>
                        <li>- Use powerup cards strategically.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
                <p>
                    We know that wildcards exists in the game too but we don't have them added in the game right now because we encountered a bug and we want to fix that before we add anything more complex in the game
                </p>
                <p>Thank you for your understand. We hope you give us your feedback about the game, so we can improve the game and make it better for everyone.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        

    </div>
    <div class="min-h-[6px]"></div>

    <section id="coming-soon" class="mt-16 p-2">
        <p class="section-kicker">
            More Games
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl mt-3">
            Coming Soon
        </h2>
        <p class="hero-description mt-4 max-w-2xl">
            Nothing hurts in giving a sneak peek.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 mt-10">
            <article
                class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-[#562447] border border-dashed border-[var(--sayori-border)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--sayori-lavender)] cursor-pointer">
                <span
                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-[rgba(185,163,230,.08)] text-[var(--sayori-orange)]">
                    Form
                </span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-5">
                    Do you have a cool guessing game idea?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">
                    Drop your ideas in the form provided.
                </p>
                <a class="sayori-btn sayori-btn-secondary bg-[#FFD34E] text-black"
                    href="https://forms.gle/w36x89tjFFxE32rY8 ">Form!</a>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>